# ── Supabase (optional: leave empty to run in local Demo Mode) ──────────────
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run supabase/schema.sql in the SQL editor
# 3. Paste the two values below (Dashboard → Settings → API), restart the app
#    (use either the legacy anon key or the new publishable key)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# or: NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
